1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,494
Buddha in GTA 6,

2
00:00:01,514 --> 00:00:02,972
the most violent game ever made,

3
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:04,030
played by a man who

4
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,089
has sworn he will never

5
00:00:05,109 --> 00:00:06,499
hurt a single living thing.

6
00:00:06,519 --> 00:00:07,489
The game drops him onto

7
00:00:07,509 --> 00:00:08,728
a street soaked in neon,

8
00:00:08,748 --> 00:00:09,361
and the very first mission

9
00:00:09,381 --> 00:00:10,294
flashes up on the screen:

10
00:00:10,314 --> 00:00:11,278
steal this car.

11
00:00:11,298 --> 00:00:13,573
So he walks up to the owner,

12
00:00:13,593 --> 00:00:15,129
looks him calmly in the eye,

13
00:00:15,149 --> 00:00:16,108
and places the car keys back

14
00:00:16,128 --> 00:00:17,265
into the man's shaking hand.

15
00:00:17,285 --> 00:00:18,509
Instead of a red wanted star, a

16
00:00:18,529 --> 00:00:19,576
golden one lights up on the

17
00:00:19,596 --> 00:00:20,820
screen, and the owner, completely lost, starts

18
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,183
quietly following him down the street.

19
00:00:22,203 --> 00:00:23,311
That's when a gang closes in

20
00:00:23,331 --> 00:00:24,439
from every side with their guns

21
00:00:24,459 --> 00:00:25,567
raised, and the game flashes its

22
00:00:25,587 --> 00:00:27,040
only instruction: pick up a weapon.

23
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,098
Now the choice is yours,

24
00:00:28,118 --> 00:00:29,020
run for your life or fight the

25
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,134
way the game wants you to,

26
00:00:30,154 --> 00:00:32,460
but Buddha does neither.

27
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,370
He sits down cross-legged in the middle

28
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,558
of the road and closes his eyes,

29
00:00:34,578 --> 00:00:35,566
and even with the whole street screaming,

30
00:00:35,586 --> 00:00:37,775
his breathing never changes.

31
00:00:37,795 --> 00:00:38,945
The gang leader walks right up

32
00:00:38,965 --> 00:00:40,311
and points his gun at his face,

33
00:00:40,331 --> 00:00:41,482
and for the first time in

34
00:00:41,502 --> 00:00:42,934
this game, nobody pulls the trigger.

35
00:00:42,954 --> 00:00:44,966
One by one the guns come down,

36
00:00:44,986 --> 00:00:45,879
until the whole city has

37
00:00:45,899 --> 00:00:46,974
stopped just to watch a man

38
00:00:46,994 --> 00:00:48,186
sitting quietly in the road.

39
00:00:48,206 --> 00:00:49,576
If you were dropped into GTA 6,

40
00:00:49,596 --> 00:00:50,050
could you play it

41
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:50,758
the way Buddha did?

42
00:00:50,778 --> 00:00:51,628
Tell me in the comments.
